<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines Feb inflation 4.4 pct vs Jan 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines Feb inflation 4.4 pct vs Jan 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine year-on-year inflation was at 4.4 percent in February compared with 5.0 percent in January and 11.8 percent in February last year, the National Statistics Office said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES		Feb 97   Jan 97  Feb 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	+0.4	 +0.6     +1.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	   4.4	  5.0     11.8</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)     234.0	233.0    224.1</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418936 Fax 8176267</p>
